  "body": "We currently don't require a body on `POST /rooms/{roomId}/receipt/{receiptType}/{eventId}`.\r\n\r\nInitially, this seems to have been a mistake, but since #10531 [v1.40.0rc2], it's a workaround because Element Android relied on that behaviour (which we broke by actually using the body for hidden read receipts in #10413 [v1.40.0rc1]).\r\n\r\n__Blockers:__\r\n\r\n- [x] Yell in Client Developers room now\r\n- [x] https://github.com/vector-im/element-android/issues/3789\r\n- [x] Figure out how long Element Android needs to propagate, set target removal date\r\n    Minimum of four weeks following release. Revisit in October.\r\n- [ ] Wait _x time_ for a fixed Android release to propagate\r\n\r\nEventually, we should return to enforcing the spec.",
